 rnote:['Afya fee = 7.5% of the buy price a week; deposit 30%; delivery, fitting and collection TSh 15,000 per hire; cleaning and safety check TSh 5,000 per return; Afya buys at 72% of shelf price. Oxygen concentrators only on a doctor’s prescription.','Ada ya Afya = 7.5% ya bei ya kununua kwa wiki; amana 30%; kufikisha, kufunga na kuchukua TSh 15,000 kwa kila ukodishaji; usafi na ukaguzi wa usalama TSh 5,000 kwa kila kurudishwa; Afya inanunua kwa 72% ya bei ya rafu. Mashine za oksijeni kwa cheti cha daktari tu.'],
